{"4579440": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Escape War", "steam_appid": 4579440, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape War</strong> is a short 3D survival game about being the last person to evacuate a city under bombardment. Your goal is simple: survive, keep moving, and find a way out before the next missile hits. The game focuses on the immediate experience of escaping a warzone rather than fighting in one. Missiles can land nearby, block your path, or kill you instantly if you react too slowly. At the same time, hunger and thirst slowly wear you down, so survival means more than avoiding explosions. There are no weapons, no reinforcements, and no second chances. You only run, evade, and try to make it out alive.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Escape War</strong> is a short 3D survival game about being the last person to evacuate a city under bombardment. Your goal is simple: survive, keep moving, and find a way out before the next missile hits. The game focuses on the immediate experience of escaping a warzone rather than fighting in one. Missiles can land nearby, block your path, or kill you instantly if you react too slowly. At the same time, hunger and thirst slowly wear you down, so survival means more than avoiding explosions. There are no weapons, no reinforcements, and no second chances. You only run, evade, and try to make it out alive.</p>", "short_description": "You are the last person to evacuate a city that is being bombed. Survive and escape.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Swedish, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese, Afrikaans, Albanian, Amharic, A